{"quest_id": 6199, "name": "帝国猟兵とオーク勇者（記憶）", "description": "オークの軍団が密林を襲撃。\n森を守るべく孤軍奮闘していた\n帝国猟兵レーゼルを救出せよ！\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "戦場の記憶～追憶の章～", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920094, "map_no": 5234, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 4000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 166, "move_speed": 400.0, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2102224, "race_id": 8, "change_to": 1, "change_condition": 2, "master_id": 30518, "global_id": 4137, "to_condition": 2, "to_global_id": 4054, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 6300, "attack": 320, "base_hp": 6300, "base_attack": 320, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 12, "attack_interval": 42, "move_speed": 1500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2111056, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 54, "master_id": 30435, "global_id": 4054, "from_condition": 2}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_count": 2, "hp": 3000, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "attack_range": 130, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 91, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2102544, "race_id": 8, "change_to": 3, "change_condition": 3, "missile_id": 113, "missile": {"speed": 10.0}, "master_id": 377, "global_id": 376, "ranged": true, "to_condition": 3, "to_global_id": 377, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 3000, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "attack_range": 130, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 1, "attack_interval": 33, "move_speed": 1200.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2102560, "race_id": 8, "missile_id": 113, "missile": {"speed": 10.0}, "master_id": 378, "global_id": 377, "ranged": true, "from_condition": 3}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 9, "form_count": 2, "hp": 4000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 166, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2102224, "race_id": 8, "change_to": 5, "change_condition": 3, "master_id": 366, "global_id": 365, "to_condition": 3, "to_global_id": 366, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 4000, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 450, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 126, "move_speed": 1200.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2102240, "race_id": 8, "master_id": 367, "global_id": 366, "from_condition": 3}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 11, "form_count": 2, "hp": 1200, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 80, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 50, "attack_interval": 221, "move_speed": 1000.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2106320, "race_id": 8, "change_to": 7, "change_condition": 3, "master_id": 800, "global_id": 799, "to_condition": 3, "to_global_id": 800, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 1200, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 130, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 141, "move_speed": 1500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2106336, "race_id": 8, "master_id": 801, "global_id": 800, "from_condition": 3}, {"enemy_id": 9, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_count": 2, "hp": 2500, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 2500, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 150, "attack_range": 140, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 191, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2102576, "race_id": 8, "change_to": 9, "change_condition": 3, "missile_id": 78, "missile": {"speed": 7.0}, "master_id": 379, "global_id": 378, "ranged": true, "to_condition": 3, "to_global_id": 379, "spawn_sec": 6}, {"enemy_id": 9, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 2500, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 2500, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 150, "attack_range": 140, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 45, "attack_interval": 161, "move_speed": 1200.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2102592, "race_id": 8, "special_effect_id": 232, "missile_id": 78, "missile": {"speed": 7.0}, "master_id": 380, "global_id": 379, "ranged": true, "from_condition": 3}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "サヨ", "text": "休憩も挟んだし、話を再開するわね。\n戦いを続ける中、王国とは別に魔物と\n戦う国家……白の帝国と出会ったのよね。", "face": "u510"}, {"name": "サヨ", "text": "オークの大群が密林に攻めてきた時も、\n彼らはジャングルを守る為に戦っていた。", "face": "u510"}, {"name": "サヨ", "text": "……けれど、部隊は壊滅寸前まで戦うも敗走。\nその後も帝国猟兵のレーゼルさんだけは\nたった一人で反攻を続けていて――", "face": "u510"}, {"name": "レーゼル", "text": "――ここまでの協力、感謝する。\nだけどオーク軍の戦力は予想を遥かに超えている。\n貴方は撤退した方が……。", "face": "u371"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "……。", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "レーゼル", "text": "撤退はしない、か。ありがとう、王子。\n独りだった私に力を貸してくれて。\n私も貴方達と一緒に戦い抜きたい。", "face": "u371"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "――少し会わない間に、\n随分と優しい目をするように\nなったのですね、レーゼルさん。", "face": "u373"}, {"name": "レーゼル", "text": "え、エリアス！？\nなぜ帝国の治癒士がこんな場所に……？\nまさか……白の帝国の援軍が到着したのか！？", "face": "u371"}, {"name": "エリアス", "text": "お待たせして、本当にすみませんでした。\n既に、後陣の準備は完了しています。", "face": "u373"}, {"name": "兵士", "text": "伝令！\nオーク軍団の接近を確認しました！\n皆さん、臨戦態勢をとってください！", "face": "l691c92aa102a"}, {"name": "ユリアン", "text": "絶好のタイミングだぜ、まったく。\nっしゃあ！　こっからが本番だぜ。\n王子、レーゼル！　オークをぶっ倒すぞ！", "face": "u7"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "サヨ", "text": "――わたしが過去に見てきた君主の中には、\n普段は正義を掲げていても、危険が迫れば我が身\n可愛さで民や兵を見捨てる君主も居たわ。", "face": "u510"}, {"name": "サヨ", "text": "でも王子はオークの大群が迫る中、\n最初は非協力的だったレーゼルさんを見捨てる事なく、\n最後には協力してオークの軍を打ち払った。", "face": "u510"}, {"name": "サヨ", "text": "危険が迫る中、自分の身を顧みず誰かを助ける。\n王子が他人を見捨てられない人だっていう事を\nこの戦いを通して感じたの。", "face": "u510"}, {"name": "サヨ", "text": "そしてレーゼルさんもこの後、帝国猟兵ではなく\n一個人としての協力を約束してくれた。王子の行動が\nレーゼルさんの気持ちを動かしたのね。", "face": "u510"}, {"name": "サヨ", "text": "こうやって、立場が違う相手でも、\n少しずつ分かり合えていければ良いよね。", "face": "u510"}]}], "active": true}